  "tool": "cd",
  "arguments": {"folder": "Lectures"}
}
```

Now, to actually create a new file named `Notes2023.txt`, I’d normally use a file‑creation or write tool. Unfortunately, the tool set I have access to doesn’t include a direct way to create a new file or write content to one. I can list the contents of the folder to confirm we’re in the right spot:

